 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Express good wishes",
   "texto": [
    "**Semoga** already appears in A2; **mudah-mudahan** also means «I wish.». Both expressions usually go to the beginning of a sentence about something that is desired.",
    "**Berharap** is to expect or wish something to happen; it does not require a special verbal form later."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Talk about plans and objectives",
   "texto": [
    "**Tercapai** means that a goal is achieved; **terwujud**, that a desire is made true; **terlaksana**, that a plan is carried out. Don't confuse the three results."
   ]
  },
